<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.meta.tunes ~ which annotators compose, and the room taxonomy

`lares sense meta [show]` prints the ingest meta-schema: the annotators the meta-model composes (entities, hall, room) and the room topic taxonomy. `seed` materializes the seed taxonomy; `annotators <csv>` sets the annotators; `room-add <topic> <kw,kw…>` sets one room's keywords; `room-rm <topic>` removes one. It reads and writes `<config-home>/meta.json` directly, no daemon.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ show · room-add

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`show` params=`~ the meta-schema`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`room-add` params=`sub/room-add topic/liturgy keywords/shrine,incense,libation ~ set one room's keywords`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sub · topic · keywords

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sub` params=`takes/word seat/1 as/<show|seed|annotators|room-add|room-rm> ~ the meta act; absent, show`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`topic` params=`takes/words seat/2 as/<csv|topic> ~ the annotators csv, or the room topic`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keywords` params=`takes/list seat/3 as/<kw,kw…> ~ room-add's keywords`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ writes this host's meta.json; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.meta.tunes]] ~ an unknown sub-verb, annotator or room, or an act missing its words`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

